{"id": "68518", "title": "情潮暗涌", "author": "闻笛同学", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68518.htm", "intro": "作者被吓哭了→全文和谐。美好世界你我共创。\r\n\r\n他们的关系，像一场狩猎游戏。\r\n祁泽墨说：“我喜欢干净的女人。\r\n简宛宛，你不爱我，这没有什么关系，你只能是我的。”\r\n我等着你，自投罗网。 \r\n---------\r\n“爱一个人就是这样，什么都包涵，什么都原谅，老觉得对方可爱、长不大、稚气，什么都是可怜的，总是舍不得。”——《胭脂》\r\n\r\n\r\n阅读提示：①本文甜宠向，前期略强取豪夺，无小三、NP等元素。\r\n②全文1V1，结局HE.", "base": "files/article/html/68/68518", "chapters": [{"title": "回家·新鲜", "file": "10533912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "预感·心虚", "file": "10533913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谎言·伪装", "file": "10533914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "叔叔·忐忑", "file": "10533915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "威胁·挫败", "file": "10533916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "软禁·冷战", "file": "10533917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "交换·讽刺", "file": "10533918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暗谋·追求", "file": "10533919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "确幸·恋爱", "file": "10533920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "绯闻·欺骗", "file": "10533921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "强硬·插手", "file": "10533922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "暗算·险胜", "file": "10533923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "抢夺·跳槽", "file": "10533924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "恐惧·重逢", "file": "10533925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "巧合·调戏", "file": "10533926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "狗仔·冷静", "file": "10533927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "玩弄·负责", "file": "10533928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "掌掴·流言", "file": "10533929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "委屈·维护", "file": "10533930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温情·难耐", "file": "10533931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "偏执·演戏", "file": "10533932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "稀罕·无耻", "file": "10533933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情愫·讽刺", "file": "10533934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "威胁·解恨", "file":